WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.600
Hello, I'm Officer Miller, a fictional practice interviewer.

00:04.300 --> 00:09.200
This is a practice pre-CAS interview, not a real university or visa interview,

00:09.700 --> 00:11.300
and it will take about two minutes,

00:11.400 --> 00:13.400
so keep your answers short and direct.

00:14.100 --> 00:14.800
Let's begin.
